lass=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">600</span> and 120 / 110 (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">600</span> and 125 /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">600</span> and 110 /  (ML/Def)</div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Extremely Good<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: orange\"><b>Very Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bag%20You%20Desire\"><img alt=\"Bag You Desire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bag_You_Desire_95b084.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ebb and Flow Map 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"189\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ebb_and_Flow_Map_1_1b91c9.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ebb and Flow Map 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"208\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ebb_and_Flow_Map_2_4a67c7.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">12.40.9997<br/>July 13, 2020<br/>Summer Update 2020</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n<b>Ebb and Flow</b> is one of the areas accessed through <a href=\"#/wiki/Zarganash\">Zarganash</a>. It is among the most challenging areas in <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia\">Tibia</a> due to the strength of the creatures, their ability to <a href=\"#/wiki/Feared\">Fear</a> you, and the map design, which often forces players to fight more than a dozen creatures at once.\n</p><p>The map in this area alternates every 2 minutes between flooded and drained states (hence its name). When the water is up, players can use rafts to move between islands on the top floor, and it's not possible to walk outside the buildings on the bottom floor. If a character is outside a building when the water rises, they will be teleported to the entrance or moved to the closest island if standing on a raft. Additionally, if a character is on a raft when the water recedes, they will \"fall\" to the bottom floor. All islands have \"holes\" that send players downstairs to the buildings, but these are one-way only. To leave the buildings, players must use the doors, which is only possible when the water is down.\n</p><p>To safely navigate this map, it is highly recommended that at least one team member uses a 2-minute timer running in a loop synchronized with the water movement. When the water is about to change, the entire team should be aware so they can act accordingly, especially if the goal is to be teleported to an island, to the entrance, or something similar.\n</p><p>Three of the four creatures in this area can use <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Feared\">Fear</a></b> (only <a href=\"#/wiki/Turbulent%20Elemental\">Turbulent Elementals</a> cannot). Fear is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Special%20Conditions\">Status Condition</a> where a character will start running away from creatures for 3 seconds, unable to stop or change direction until this time has passed. When feared, a character cannot use any spells but can still use items such as runes and potions. One way to handle Fear is to throw bomb runes (such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb\">Fire Bombs</a>), as it will prevent your character from moving over them when feared.\n</p><p>Besides the loss of control over your character, being feared is also very risky on the upper floor of this place, as characters can be feared into jumping down one of the holes with no way to return using the same path, or even feared to a different island via multiple rafts just as the water is about to recede. These events can separate team members, forcing them to survive full spawns and figure out a way to regroup.\n</p><p>It's one of the areas of the <a href=\"#/quest/soul-war-quest\">Soul War Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bony%20Sea%20Devil\"><img alt=\"Bony Sea Devil\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bony_Sea_Devil_73bb3d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Bony%20Sea%20Devil\">Bony Sea Devil</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">17,328</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">24,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-6× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Health%20Potion\">Ultimate Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Shimmering%20Pearl%20%28Brown%29\">Giant Shimmering Pearl (Brown)</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\">Gold Ingot</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Shimmering%20Pearl%20%28Green%29\">Giant Shimmering Pearl (Green)</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Glacier Kilt (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Gem\">Violet Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hailstorm%20Rod\">Hailstorm Rod</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Underworld Rod (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Northwind Rod (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Voodoo\">Wand of Voodoo</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Green Crystal Fragment (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Onyx%20Chip\">Onyx Chip</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Quartz\">Rainbow Quartz</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Rod (Creature Product) (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Jaws (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Glacial%20Rod\">Glacial Rod</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Skullcracker%20Armor\">Skullcracker Ar